				{
					"id": 760980706,
					"content": "<color=#00E1FFF>一号研究区</color>：<color=#FF5E41FF>警告</color>。检测到高浓度深渊污染。当前外溢风险：<color=#FF5E41FF>极高</color>。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760980707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "避难所主控制终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 760980707,
					"content": "<color=#FF5E41FF>末日</color>净化系统：<color=#FF5E41FF>阻塞中</color>。已派遣维修人员。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760980708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "避难所主控制终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 760980708,
					"content": "距离上次呼叫维修已有：<color=#FF5E41FF>错误</color>标准小时。请勿恐慌，公民，保持冷静并等待监督指示。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760980709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "避难所主控制终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 760980709,
					"content": "呜哇，这个什么净化系统不是完全没有用嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760980710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760980710,
					"content": "我懂了，「末日」其实就是指深渊污染吧？唉，明明建造避难所就是为了抵御深渊，结果没想到里面比外面侵蚀得还严重…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760980711,
						760980713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760980711,
					"content": "看来没能抵御成功呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760980712
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760980712,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，我们想想办法吧？放着不管的话，深渊灾害说不定会外溢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760980715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760980715,
					"content": "先去一号研究区看看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760980716
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760980716,
					"content": "嗯嗯，我们走！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760980713,
					"content": "真的只是这么简单吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760980714
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760980714,
					"content": "我也搞不清楚啦。不过，要是放着不管的话，深渊灾厄说不定会外溢…还是得先把问题解决掉才行呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760980715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
