					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760981708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760981708,
					"content": "好，这样一来就圆满解——欸？等一下，这是什么东西？",
